Feature addition: aura follows surface contour via MeshSurface raycasting.

This commit modifies 3 files (+767/-38 lines), spanning 2 TypeScript source, 1 tests.
This feature extends the Geometry Wars 3D codebase with new functionality. The implementation follows the project's established patterns and maintains compatibility with both single-player and multiplayer code paths where applicable.

Additional context from the commit body:
AuraManager now projects ring vertices onto the mesh surface using
closestPointOnSurface() instead of rendering flat discs. On cube edges/
vertices, the aura naturally wraps around surface contours. Added
setMeshSurface() method, integrated in multiplayer-main.ts.
20 new tests for surface projection across sphere/torus/cube.

